*> ALTER changes where a GO TO goes: PARA-B is reached only through the
*> altered GO TO in SWITCH, and PARA-C not at all.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ALTERS.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    ALTER SWITCH TO PROCEED TO PARA-B
    GO TO SWITCH.
SWITCH.
    GO TO PARA-A.
PARA-A.
    DISPLAY "A"
    STOP RUN.
PARA-B.
    DISPLAY "B"
    STOP RUN.
PARA-C.
    DISPLAY "C"
    STOP RUN.
